idthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/60632f2c4e50bc736e44e19bf0bb16ae70dbd1f2\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/60632f2c4e50bc736e44e19bf0bb16ae70dbd1f2\" data-origin-width=\"3240\" data-origin-height=\"4320\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e3d8b437b912daadac7aa8499fbacbb6781063a3\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e3d8b437b912daadac7aa8499fbacbb6781063a3\" data-origin-width=\"3240\" data-origin-height=\"4320\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a086f3f99439a2ec4a751365850c5778da2ab636\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a086f3f99439a2ec4a751365850c5778da2ab636\" data-origin-width=\"3240\" data-origin-height=\"4320\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a18710e6022fac7ad9e423d7926136d92c9c7575\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a18710e6022fac7ad9e423d7926136d92c9c7575\" data-origin-width=\"3240\" data-origin-height=\"4320\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0fe73c5435822d322c2b87d2e0b31a334d99a094\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0fe73c5435822d322c2b87d2e0b31a334d99a094\" data-origin-width=\"3240\" data-origin-height=\"4320\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/de7e8819e47265e8eb7779c99bc5bd8b11d877a7\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/de7e8819e47265e8eb7779c99bc5bd8b11d877a7\" data-origin-width=\"3240\" data-origin-height=\"4320\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/59309a0fb36948d03f6b101951b7aeaf2184ad70\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/59309a0fb36948d03f6b101951b7aeaf2184ad70\" data-origin-width=\"3240\" data-origin-height=\"4320\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\"> 매번 새로운 단원 들어갈 때마다 &quot;어떻게 하면 아이들이 더 흥미를 느낄까?&quot; 고민하게 되죠. 특히 1단원은 계산도 나오고 &#39;통곡의 벽&#39;이라 불리는 법칙들이 많아 아이들이 힘들어하는 구간이기도 합니다.</span><br><br><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">그래서 제가 수업 때 직접 활용했던 핵심 요약과 아이들 에게 전해줬던 여담 &amp; 드립들을 정리해 보았습니다. 수업 중간중간 환기용으로 쓰시기에 딱 좋을 거예요!</span><br><br><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">앞으로 대단원 하나가 마무리될 때마다 이런 식으로 수업 기록을 아카이빙 해보려 합니다. 작은 자료지만 선생님들의 풍성한 수업에 보탬이 되었으면 좋겠습니다. </span></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
